          "text": "Environmental officers noted salt exposure near the coast while preparing a replacement frame. At the wetland monitoring tower, a cable runs from the top of a 45 m vertical post to an anchor 60 m from its base. Another 2 m is required for fastening. Find the total cable length in metres. Enter the numerical value only."
